      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of hollowness and worthlessness is a profound echo of the immense loss you've suffered. It's understandable that when everything external has crumbled, your sense of self feels fragile and empty. But your value isn't tied to the kingdom or what others demanded; it exists within you regardless of the ruins. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate these deep feelings of meaninglessness.",
